            "detailed_description": "<strong>Portarius</strong> - is a game where players must solve physical puzzles and challenges by opening portals to maneuvering objects, and themselves, through space while making their ways to the center of the Earth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three chapters each with its own challenges and atmosphere<br></li><li>Portals make every journey unique<br></li><li>Artful and lush 2D graphics<br></li><li>Compete against other players on the global leader-board<br></li><li>Realistic physics<br></li><li>Great soundtrack</li></ul>",
